src/resolvers/patch-with-tools.ts(1450,205): error TS1005: ';' expected.
src/resolvers/patch-with-tools.ts
- anchor_not_found: {"error":"old_string not found in file. The closest real text is lines 1443-1448 of 1559, VERBATIM:\n1443: // are the same log line, and the pass count measures nothing. Observed 2026-09-10:\n1444: //

Do not repeat these failures. Address the specific cause named above.

